      "page": 402,
      "ruku": 346,
      "hizbQuarter": 161,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3388,
      "text": "You [O Prophet] never recited any book before this, nor did you write with your hand. Otherwise, the people of falsehood would have raised suspicions.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 402,
      "ruku": 346,
      "hizbQuarter": 161,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3389,
      "text": "Rather, this [Qur’an] is clear verses [preserved] in the hearts of those who have been given knowledge. And none rejects Our verses except the wrongdoers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 402,
      "ruku": 346,
      "hizbQuarter": 161,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3390,
      "text": "They say, “Why is it that no signs have been sent down to him from his Lord?” Say, “The signs are only with Allah, and I am only a clear warner.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 402,
      "ruku": 346,
      "hizbQuarter": 161,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3391,
      "text": "Is it not enough for them that We have sent down to you the Book which is being recited to them? Indeed, there is a mercy and reminder in it for people who believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 402,
      "ruku": 346,
      "hizbQuarter": 161,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3392,
      "text": "Say, “Allah is Sufficient as a Witness between me and you. He knows all that is in the heavens and earth. Those who believe in falsehood and disbelieve in Allah, it is they who are the losers.”",
